{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far future of 2027, corporations battle for<i> world domination...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When his home was to be demolished for new expensive condos, the lazy shark-man Biff Steaks resolves to put a stop to the madmen in charge. However, he would soon find himself caught in a power struggle between two rival companies. He's recruited by Sue Flay, a jaded professional who takes her work seriously. Together, they'll secure Mask Corporations spot as the number one syndicate in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/e59df97c8d423bdfb1c1f6abe3b50c21.poster.avif?t=1759357512\" width=884 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/e59df97c8d423bdfb1c1f6abe3b50c21.webm?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/e59df97c8d423bdfb1c1f6abe3b50c21.mp4?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.poster.avif?t=1759357512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.webm?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.mp4?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIS DEMO INCLUDES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An singleplayer excerpt of the first and second level available through STORY mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BONUS levels through episode select!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CO-OP game modes available, including OVERTIME mode and a boss rush!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through armies of goons and unique bosses in a variety of levels! Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover combines the chaos of classic 2D beat em' ups with the freeform combat systems of character action games. Battle through unique environments led by their distinct bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.poster.avif?t=1759357512\" width=884 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.webm?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.mp4?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.poster.avif?t=1759357512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.webm?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.mp4?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for some overtime?\u00a0Play co-op and enjoy some quality bonding time shooting for high scores in multiple arenas or go for the best time in boss rush mode! Select from a pool of eccentric characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/16c9ff0a347bc5b27a044b4b7b7beef4.poster.avif?t=1759357512\" width=884 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/16c9ff0a347bc5b27a044b4b7b7beef4.webm?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/extras/16c9ff0a347bc5b27a044b4b7b7beef4.mp4?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape this corporate conspiracy, you'll have to make some allies and enemies along the way. Fight bosses such as the undead Franky Furter, or the alien Ez Cargo! It's time to earn your pay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo story campaign featuring two playable characters with unique movesets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op mode that lets you and a friend take on the game together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive combat that makes use of juggling, wallbouncing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple gamemodes that can be played solo or co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique levels and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classy pixel art visuals</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915300?t=1759357512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915300?t=175