0a347bc5b27a044b4b7b7beef4.mp4?t=1759357512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape this corporate conspiracy, you'll have to make some allies and enemies along the way. Fight bosses such as the undead Franky Furter, or the alien Ez Cargo! It's time to earn your pay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo story campaign featuring two playable characters with unique movesets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op mode that lets you and a friend take on the game together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive combat that makes use of juggling, wallbouncing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple gamemodes that can be played solo or co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique levels and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classy pixel art visuals</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bugzsteaks"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3822860","name":"Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915300/bb50275de0208bcccbb3ac13a9132d438ef78868/header.jpg?t=1759357512","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3915300/410726649/b9591f1dddb9024a6b04d0aaf0527adc5f43c5db/1753766777/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759049485","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3915300/410726649/b9591f1dddb9024a6b04d0aaf0527adc5f43c5db/1753766777/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759049485","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3915300/410726649/b9591f1dddb9024a6b04d0aaf0527adc5f43c5db/1753766777/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759049485","id":257175119,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175119/movie480.mp4